# Claude Code: none of these are needed. The hooks read your existing
# ai-center connection straight out of ~/.claude.json (the same one you
# already set up when you added ai-center as an MCP server) and auto-select
# your project — every user belongs to exactly one project by design, so
# there's nothing to disambiguate.
#
# Codex needs these set:

AI_CENTER_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:3000
AI_CENTER_API_KEY=
